WEBVTT

00:04:59.156 --> 00:05:02.636
who were our original
participants in our study.

00:05:02.676 --> 00:05:03.836
We asked them,

00:05:03.836 --> 00:05:09.316
Who could you call in the middle
of the night if you were sick or scared?

00:05:10.276 --> 00:05:15.076
And many of our people could list
several other people they could call

00:05:15.116 --> 00:05:16.836
if they were in trouble.

00:05:16.876 --> 00:05:19.356
Some people couldn't list anyone.

00:05:19.396 --> 00:05:23.076
There wasn't a person on the planet
who they could turn to

00:05:23.076 --> 00:05:25.196
if they were sick or scared.

00:05:25.236 --> 00:05:29.596
And what we find is that having
at least one person in your life

00:05:29.636 --> 00:05:31.756
who you feel really has your back,